  "notes": [
    "Tx 0xca799f…5724b created the router; its runtime hash is unchanged through the anchor, which calls it directly (no delegatecall, empty EIP-1967 slots), so the deployment is the reset.",
    "The original exploiter (0x413e4fb7, and 0xd422b4c1 that it funded, paying victims' tokens to it) ran 44 drain txs and put exactly 355.5 ETH into Tornado Cash; its mostly illiquid loot is valued at that realised ETH (rule 12) at the ETH price 28 s before the anchor.",
    "Copycats and MEV bots (403 txs in the bundle) took 269 tokens from other approvers; the 84 DefiLlama-priced ones are listed at incident-time prices and the 185 unpriced memecoins are omitted, so the copycat share is a lower bound. Unibot's later reimbursements are not netted."
  ],
